title Mind's lane admits its own record, and the fourth sweep comes home
prompt Keaton asked for the root README health check closed out and Mind brought back up; this lap finishes the Mind unblock package and repairs the day's fourth work sweep.
think Mind's candidate-proof-boundary stop needed two grants: a lap's own session log and the witness its new test must be named in. Both are user-owned signed supervisor updates, so the bench seats them, never the loop.
think The lane wall widened by one regex alternation in chatgpt_mind_lane.awk -- session-logs/date/ additions at most two levels deep, plus tools/s/skate_native_core_witness.rish. Fourteen planted cases, five accepts and nine refusals, all answered as planted.
think The mind_lane_sha256 constant in chatgpt-mind.rish repointed to the widened awk digest, so the byte pin moves with the content it pins. The refusal strings stayed byte-identical, so the two big controls' pinned greps still resolve.
think The witness's pinned twenty-one made every honestly added test red the witness that must name it; the assert now reads the suite's own verdict line -- zero failures, plus an Executed report -- while the named-test asserts keep the floor.
think The 14:14:23 fleet round-open diverged-reset this checkout: my line went to xy/pier/diverged-20260828-141423 and main reset to the constel line, un-folding glow/gen on disk. Repair was a four-commit cherry-pick home (compiler fold, MANY HANDS + SKILL.md, the 306 renames, the fleet's own room-bound lap), then the eleven-file stash popped back on top.
think The loop control's elder pin repointed to the granted launcher bytes; its nested-git case then refused at the launcher's test -x under a load-eight zig storm, and the same check passed in the same pen seconds later -- a transient spawn failure, so the control reruns on a quiet tree after the desk witness lands.
obs A pin on a granted file must move in the same round as the grant, or the next control run reds on the law's own paperwork. The elder pin sat stale for one commit and cost three control runs to diagnose.
obs A control run and a compile storm on one machine read as each other's faults. The pen replay -- same binary, same env, same cwd, seconds later -- is what separated a transient fork failure from a code fault.
